
@CustomerManagement.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5123

### 1. Get All Customers
GET {{CustomerManagement.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/Customer
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Get Customer By ID
GET {{CustomerManagement.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/Customer/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Create Customer
POST {{CustomerManagement.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/Customer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Priya Sharma",
  "email": "priya@gmail.com",
  "mobile": "9876543210",
  "city": "Chennai"
}

###

### 4. Update Customer
PUT {{CustomerManagement.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/Customer/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Priya Sharma Updated",
  "email": "priya.updated@gmail.com",
  "mobile": "9876543210",
  "city": "Chennai",
  "isActive": true
}

###

### 5. Delete Customer
DELETE {{CustomerManagement.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/Customer/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 6. Pagination - Page 1
GET {{CustomerManagement.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/Customer/paged?pageNumber=1&pageSize=5
Accept: application/json

###

### 7. Pagination - Page 2
GET {{CustomerManagement.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/Customer/paged?pageNumber=2&pageSize=5
Accept: application/json

###

### 8. Pagination - Invalid Page
GET {{CustomerManagement.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/Customer/paged?pageNumber=0&pageSize=5
Accept: application/json

###

### 9. Search - Customer Name
GET {{CustomerManagement.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/Customer/paged?pageNumber=1&pageSize=5&search=Priya
Accept: application/json

###

### 10. Filter - City
GET {{CustomerManagement.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/Customer/paged?pageNumber=1&pageSize=5&city=Chennai
Accept: application/json

###

### 11. Search + City Filter
GET {{CustomerManagement.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/Customer/paged?pageNumber=1&pageSize=5&search=Priya&city=Chennai
Accept: application/json

###

### 12. Search + Pagination - Page 2
GET {{CustomerManagement.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/Customer/paged?pageNumber=2&pageSize=5&search=Priya
Accept: application/json

###

### 13. API Version 1
GET {{CustomerManagement.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/Customer
Accept: application/json

###

### 14. API Version 2
GET {{CustomerManagement.API_HostAddress}}/api/v2/Customer
Accept: application/json
